# HP50g stock ARMToolbox install.
# Hardware-proven HP50g procedure:
#   RPN, copy SETUP.BIN to HOME, put real 2. on the stack,
#   VAR -> SETUP.BIN, then warmstart with ON+C.
# After warmstart, inspect port 2 so CI records whether library 275 exists.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
5000 tap mode
5500 tap neg
6000 tap f6
7000 chord lshift files
9200 capture files
9500 tap up
9800 tap f6
11500 capture sd
12000 tap enter
12800 capture sd-setup
13200 tap f2
14200 capture copy-destination
14500 tap down
14800 tap f6
16600 capture copy-result
17100 tap on
18000 capture home-after-copy
18500 tap two
18800 tap period
19100 tap enter
19900 capture port-number
20400 tap var
21500 capture vars
21900 tap f1
23500 capture setup-executed
24500 chord on f3
26500 capture warmstart
27000 chord rshift two
28200 capture lib
28600 tap f3
29900 capture port2
30300 finish-install
